SetPaused_Concrete_Test
├── when pausing
│   ├── when the caller is neither the guardian nor the operator
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when the caller is the guardian or the operator
│       ├── given the market to pause does not exist
│       │   └── it should revert
│       └── given the market to pause exists
│           ├── it should pause the market, even one already paused
│           └── it should emit {PauseChanged}
└── when unpausing
    ├── when the caller is not the operator
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when the caller is the operator
        ├── given the market to unpause does not exist
        │   └── it should revert
        └── given the market to unpause exists
            ├── it should unpause the market
            └── it should emit {PauseChanged}
